libreswan (5.4.2-1+xauthotp1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * IKEv1 XAUTH client: support OTP and PASSCODE (libreswan#2265):
    - whack: add --xauthotp option and RC_ENTEROTP prompt
      ("--xauthotp -" reads the OTP from stdin).
    - pluto: accept XAUTH_TYPE_OTP and XAUTH_PASSCODE.
    - whack: let Ctrl-C interrupt password/OTP prompts.
    - pluto: don't revive a connection when an XAUTH prompt is unanswered.
    - pluto: time out whack prompts after 300 seconds.

 -- Javier Bértoli <javier.bertoli@breq.io>  Thu, 19 Nov 2026 10:48:49 +0000

libreswan (5.4.2-1) unstable; urgency=high

  * New upstream release 5.4.2.
  * Security fixes:
    - CVE-2026-110339: NULL pointer dereference on empty PKCS#7 payload.
    - CVE-2026-115846: IKE_INTERMEDIATE addkey bypass.
  * IKEv2: fix AUTH calculation for non-PSK with INTERMEDIATE.
  * IKEv2: send INTERNAL_IP6_DNS attribute as 16 bytes (#3134).
  * ipsec import: fix automated passwordless PKCS#12 import.

 -- Libreswan Team <team@libreswan.org>  Mon, 16 Nov 2026 01:00:00 +0200

